.TH BNVIM 1 "2026-08-14" "bedit 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bnvim \- edit files with Neovim and preserve revisions with Bedit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bnvim
.RI [ nvim-options ] " file ..."
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bnvim
passes arguments directly to Neovim while Bedit watches explicit and safely
discovered same-session files for saved changes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bedit (1),
.BR bvi (1)
